    },
    {
      "s": "",
      "t": "A",
      "n": "Intro2Audio"
    },
    {
      "s": "Dans le classique Seigneur des mouches de William Golding, la personne qui tenait la conque avait le droit de parler lors des réunions. ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "728872_1",
      "n": "ExplanationAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "Et si vous avez lu le livre, vous savez qu’il se termine par un gala de collecte de fonds très tendu. ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "728873_1",
      "n": "JokeAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "If the cast of <i>Vanderpump Rules</i> enacted the same rules as the petulant children in <i>Lord of The Flies</i>, who would have the right to hold the floor?",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "728869_1",
      "n": "QuestionAudio"
    }
